---
source: tests/cli.rs
expression: "section(&text, \"long-context\")"
---
long-context
  50% of calls carried more than 1,000 cached tokens and used 19% of the
  energy. Every new and output token re-reads that context.
  What you can do:
    claude-code:
      /compact during a task
      /clear between tasks
    codex:
      /compact during a task
      /new between tasks
    pi:
      /compact during a task
      /new between tasks
  To see the effect, run this after the change:
  `tokendraw findings --since <tomorrow>`
